  "label": "The orangutan is mapped as the 'nigger' racial slur",
  "description": "The visual entity 'orangutan' is mapped onto the textual entity 'nigger' through the analogical mapping. The image of the orangutan (a primate) is juxtaposed with the racial slur 'nigger', creating a direct visual association that reinforces the anti-Black stereotype of equating Black people with apes. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it dehumanizes Black individuals by visually linking them to primates via the slur.",
